== Progress

We started with broad search for any research related to growing shapes.
Then we evaluated a select few (@GNG, @SC, @NCA) to assess strengths.
Candidates that passed the threshold moved on to the coding playground.
The goal of generating trees was most important, but @NCA made us think
about other vegetation and even structures.
By exploring prior work, we got a grasp on the possibilities.

Many experiments had to be cut short as they would need
their own dedicated research, see @sec:future_work.
The feasability of modifying algorithms for e.g. @LOD remains unknown.
